etitive financial picture for Democrats.\n\nNo public general-election polls are available, so the outlook rests on fundamentals, expert ratings, and markets. Every major rater calls the seat Solid or Safe Republican, and prediction markets price Rourk's chances near 8%. The expectation is a Republican hold by a double-digit margin, with meaningful uncertainty given the absence of polling.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.0486, "margin": -10.61}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.0248, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.0573, "margin": -11.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.0508, "margin": -12.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.0503, "margin": -11.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.0331, "margin": -12.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.0321, "margin": -13.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.0612, "margin": -11.0}]}